# Live session log (mandatory — 응답없음 diagnosis)

**Status:** Added 2026-07-28 (v0.8.346).

## Purpose

When Windows shows **응답 없음** or the user force-kills PIPBONG, the crash/hang report dialog may not appear. **`LiveSessionLog`** always appends to **`live-session/latest.log`** so agents can diagnose from the file.

## User → AI

1. User reports 응답없음 / Not Responding / no error report → read **`live-session/latest.log`** first (repo `live-session/` or `%LOCALAPPDATA%/PIPBONG/PIPBONG/live-session/latest.log`).
2. Optional: `.\scripts\analyze-live-session.ps1`
3. Do **not** require workflow block lists for first-pass diagnosis.

Full handover: [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) — **§8.18 Live session log**.
